    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can mold your hexed curse from one creature to another. When the creature cursed by your <em>Hexblade’s Curse</em> dies, you can apply the curse to a different creature you can see within 30 feet of you (no action required), provided you aren't Incapacitated.</p><p>When you apply the curse in this way, you don't regain Hit Points from the death of the previously cursed creature.</p>",
